==Danish==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|da|paa}}

===Etymology===
{{rebracketing|da}} of older {{m|da|oppå}}, from {{der|da|non|upp}} + {{m|non|á}}, compare {{cog|en|'pon}} from {{m|en|upon}}. The preposition {{m|da|å||on}} is still used in some Jutlandic dialects in the same sense.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|da|[pʰɔ̽]}}, (at the end of a clause) {{IPA|da|[ˈpʰɔ̽ˀ]}}
* {{rhymes|da|ɑː|s=1}}

===Preposition===
{{head|da|preposition}}

# [[on]]
#: {{syn|da|å|q1=Jutlandic}}

===Adverb===
