==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology===
{{rebracketing|nb}} of {{der|nb|non|upp}} {{m|non|á}}, compare {{cog|en|upon}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nb|/poː/}}

===Preposition===
{{head|nb|preposition}}

# [[on]]
#: {{ux|nb|Boken er '''på''' bordet|The book is '''on''' the table|inline=1}}
# [[on]], [[against]], [[touching]]; hanging from or being attached to (a vertical surface)
#: {{ux|nb|Eplet henger '''på''' den grenen.|The apple is hanging '''on''' that branch.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|Skiltet '''på''' veggen.|The sign '''on''' the wall.|inline=1}}
# [[on]] (a certain day)
#: {{ux|nb|'''På''' julaften.|'''On''' Christmas eve.|inline=1}}
# [[at]] (some abstract concepts)
#: {{ux|nb|Jeg er '''på''' jobb.|I am '''at''' work.|inline=1}}
# [[at]] (concerning time)
#: {{ux|nb|'''På''' den tiden...|'''At''' that time...|inline=1}}
# [[in]] (a language or dialect)
#: {{ux|nb|Si det '''på''' norsk.|Say it '''in''' Norwegian.|inline=1}}

===Adverb===
{{head|nb|adverb}}

# {{lb|nb|of machines, etc}} [[turned on]]; [[functioning]]

